      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i have this really weird pain in my chest... it feels like a sharp tearing sensation and it goes right through to my shoulder blades. i think i maybe pulled a muscle at the gym yesterday or maybe its just bad heartburn from dinner. is there anything i can take for the pain or should i just wait it out?",
