      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i dont really want to go to the er if i can help it. the wait times are insane and i dont think it's that bad, it just hits in waves. like it comes and goes. is it possible it's just acid reflux? could i just try taking some extra antacids or maybe some ibuprofen to see if it settles down? i really dont want to deal with a hospital bill if i just pulled a muscle.",
