      "content": "thanks, that makes me feel a lot better. i was really worried for a sec. i actually have some of those strong antacids my doctor gave me for my gastritis before, the ones that are like 1000mg. would it be okay if i just took one of those instead of the omeprazole to make sure it works faster? and can i take it with some aspirin? i feel like the aspirin might help the chest tightness too.",
